Quick Start
Clone or Download: Download the index.html file or clone this repository:
git clone https://github.com/imsmch/timers.git
Run Locally: Open index.html directly in any web browser. No web server or installation required.

Deployment (GitHub Pages)
To host this project for free using GitHub Pages:

Push index.html to the main branch of your GitHub repository.

Go to Settings > Pages.

Under Build and deployment > Branch, select main and / (root).

Click Save. The app will be live at https://<username>.github.io/<repo-name>/.

Tech Stack
Tailwind CSS: Utility-first styling via CDN.

FontAwesome: Interface icons.

Web Audio API: Browser-native tone generator for alarm ringers.

Web Storage API: Browser localStorage for label state.
